<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WinStar restarted as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WinStar restarted as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it reinitiated coverage of WinStar Communications Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- In early Nasdaq trade, WinStar shares rose 15/16 to 20-3/4.</p>
